      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We'd very much like to get to a place where we can have our creators earn. We mention this in the VRC+ blog and regularly in our messaging. Moving real money around a virtual economy and then cashing out from it is not something you can just slap together. It's a VERY difficult thing to achieve for lots of reasons including legal ones. But, rest assured, we're working towards that. VRC+ is the first step on that ladder.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
